<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3925/30 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6940/45 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9061/66 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4540/50 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.93/97  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7020/40   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1674.0/5.5  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     124.71/76   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6610/85   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8595/45   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4531/51   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.4343/53</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$0.7764/69</p>
</text>
